*** Keywords ***
Phase error check in syslog
    [Documentation]  If FID: 10 was detected on BTS, check of syslog will start. If syslog exists, it will be checked
    ...              for phase error function prints and it values like HPF and previous power on, if those
    ...              values are in syslog, they will be returned as those values might help in investigation of FID:10
    ...              reason.
    ...              To allow syslog collection, swconfig.txt has to contain flag 0x10041 with particular value i.e.
    ...              0x10041=5
    Robot Log Operation                                 Checking if FID:10 was detected on BTS
    ${was_fid_10_detected}=                             Private Check If Fid 10 Was Detected
    ${directory_check}=                                 Run keyword if    ${was_fid_10_detected} == True
    ...                                                 Private Check If Directory Exist And It Is Not Empty
    ${syslog_path}=                                     Run keyword if    ${directory_check} == True
    ...                                                 btslog_parser.get_all_btslog_files_path
    Run keyword if                                      ${directory_check} == False
    ...                                                 Robot Log Operation    Directory or syslog files do not exist
    Run keyword if                                      ${directory_check} == True
    ...                                                 Private Log Information If Phase Errors Are Visible In Syslog
    ...                                                 ${syslog_path}


Private Check If Fid 10 Was Detected
    [Arguments]                                         ${fault_id}=10
    ...                                                 ${bts_type}=GNB
    ${was_fid10_detected}=                              Alarms.Was alarm detected
    ...                                                 fault_id=${fault_id}
    ...                                                 bts_type=${bts_type}
    [Return]                                            ${was_fid10_detected}


Private Check If Directory Exist And It Is Not Empty
    [Arguments]                                         ${btslog_directory}=/tmp/btslog2
    ...                                                 ${extension}=.LOG
    Robot Log Operation                                 FID: 10 was detected
    Robot Log Operation                                 Checking if directory (${btslog_directory}) and files exist
    ${is_directory_existing}                            vm.check_if_directory_with_logs_exists
    ...                                                 path=${btslog_directory}
    ${is_file_existing_with_extension}                  vm.check_if_directory_contains_files_with_extension
    ...                                                 path=${btslog_directory}
    ...                                                 extension=${extension}
    ${is_directory_and_file_existing}=                  Evaluate    ${is_directory_existing} and ${is_file_existing_with_extension}
    [Return]                                            ${is_directory_and_file_existing}


Private Log Information If Phase Errors Are Visible In Syslog
    [Arguments]                                         ${syslog_path}
    Robot Log Operation                                 Starting FID:10 syslog check
    ${phase_prints_info}=                               btslog_parser.get_information_with_phase_error_presence_in_syslog
    ...                                                 logfile_path=${syslog_path}
    Robot Log Warning                                   ${phase_prints_info}
